# a family photo of the people there
@k.procedures.method.a_family_photo_of_the_people_there k.procedures.method name="a family photo of the people there" about="When there are people in the picture, a family photo is those people arranged in the layout \"family photo\"." act=make example="a family photo" example="arrange everyone for a family photo" core.source="hand-core 1"
